### List API documentation files
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/api-docs HTTP/1.1

### Get markdown API doc
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/api-docs/API_DOCS.md HTTP/1.1

### Get HTML API doc
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/api-docs/framework_fetch.html HTTP/1.1

### Get API doc — invalid name (path traversal)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/api-docs/../package.json HTTP/1.1

### Get API doc — not found
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/api-docs/missing.md HTTP/1.1
